  "title": "Property Damage Policy Change Request Form",
  "subtitle": "A decision-ready property damage policy change request that preserves identity, facts, evidence, authorization, exceptions, and accountable handoff without replacing the controlling policy or qualified judgment.",
  "description": "An original property damage policy change request for damaged premises, contents, and loss area with domain-specific intake, investigation, evidence, decision, escalation, audit, and closeout controls.",
  "use_case": "Use when the property claim intake or adjusting owner must open and control a policy change request for damaged premises, contents, and loss area. The record closes only after evidence and limitations are visible, authorized decisions are distinguishable from pending review, exceptions have owners, and the next recipient accepts the handoff.",
  "risk_tier": "B",
